\newlabel{fig:heatmap_eff}{{10}{9}{Reconstruction efficiency vs ghost rate and drop rate. Efficiency degrades primarily along the drop-rate axis. Ghost hits have minimal impact because the $\gamma $-term suppresses false segments effectively.\relax }{figure.caption.11}{}}
